# dd-shim-gl GLES2 + EGL entry-point manifest — the surface-complete symbol set libGLESv2.so.2 and
# libEGL.so.1 must export. GENERATED from the Khronos API registry (gl.xml / egl.xml) by
# `registry/extract_from_khronos.py`; do NOT hand-edit. Regenerate when bumping the API level.
#
# Rows: <LIB>\t<name>\t<return-type>\t<paramType|paramName;...>
#   LIB = GL  -> GLES2 (gl.xml feature api="gles2", GL_ES_VERSION_2_0..3_2)
#   LIB = EGL -> EGL   (egl.xml feature api="egl",  EGL_VERSION_1_0..1_5)
